(6037543, 887746, 100820, '<td valign="top">aesthetically i am not a fan of the letterbox framing, and i really think that it detracts from the image in this case, it is very "heavy" for such a fun and lighthearted moment.</td>', 'aesthetically i am not a fan of the letterbox framing, and i really think that it detracts from the image in this case, it is very "heavy" for such a fun and lighthearted moment.', '2010-06-02 13:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6037545, 886926, 100820, '<td valign="top">nice capture.  i think i would have liked a tighter crop.</td>', 'nice capture.  i think i would have liked a tighter crop.', '2010-06-02 13:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6037548, 887703, 100820, '<td valign="top">i really dont think the b&amp;w works in this case - it is very gray and washed out.  the cropping is also awkward, where you lose the front of her chair, and the composition is very busy.  I also feel no connection to the subject - she is blending in with all the gray tones and you can actually see enough of her...  i would have liked some "face" or some eye contact.</td>', 'i really dont think the b&w works in this case - it is very gray and washed out.  the cropping is also awkward, where you lose the front of her chair, and the composition is very busy.  I also feel no connection to the subject - she is blending in with all the gray tones and you can actually see enough of her...  i would have liked some "face" or some eye contact.', '2010-06-02 13:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6037550, 887662, 100820, '<td valign="top">i like the idea, but the dogs leg just showing up there gives the impression that it is dismemebered...  well, not really, obviously, but it seem disembodied and out of place.</td>', 'i like the idea, but the dogs leg just showing up there gives the impression that it is dismemebered...  well, not really, obviously, but it seem disembodied and out of place.', '2010-06-02 13:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6037552, 887718, 100820, '<td valign="top">the quality is terrible, even though i love the moment that you captured.  maybe in b&amp;w the graininess may have worked?</td>', 'the quality is terrible, even though i love the moment that you captured.  maybe in b&w the graininess may have worked?', '2010-06-02 13:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6037557, 886746, 100820, '<td valign="top">cute moment, although i really dont like the desaturation in this case.  it seems to give the image a very grow, overcast, almost depressing feel.  not what you were going for, i dont think!</td>', 'cute moment, although i really dont like the desaturation in this case.  it seems to give the image a very grow, overcast, almost depressing feel.  not what you were going for, i dont think!', '2010-06-02 13:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
