(6038432, 887554, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea here, and a great capture. I do wish it were ever so sharper. Looks like the focus ended up at the front of the nest instead of the eyes. Still, it''s really cool.</td>', 'I really like the idea here, and a great capture. I do wish it were ever so sharper. Looks like the focus ended up at the front of the nest instead of the eyes. Still, it''s really cool.', '2010-06-02 23:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6038434, 887611, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cool idea. Great use of DOF. My suggestions: maybe crop a bite tighter on the top and bottom, and the blue cast on the lower left corner is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Cool idea. Great use of DOF. My suggestions: maybe crop a bite tighter on the top and bottom, and the blue cast on the lower left corner is a bit distracting.', '2010-06-02 23:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6038437, 886867, 114225, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea. Good perspective on this moment. I see a lot of noise, possibly from jpeg conversion, that is taking away a bit from this image.</td>', 'Excellent idea. Good perspective on this moment. I see a lot of noise, possibly from jpeg conversion, that is taking away a bit from this image.', '2010-06-02 23:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6038441, 887717, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot, with perfect coloring. It doesn''t strike me as family related. Maybe if there were two cats?</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot, with perfect coloring. It doesn''t strike me as family related. Maybe if there were two cats?', '2010-06-02 23:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6038443, 887304, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great idea for this challenge. Very creative. The perspective does work for this, although I sort of wonder what it would look like straight on (camera on the ground).</td>', 'Great idea for this challenge. Very creative. The perspective does work for this, although I sort of wonder what it would look like straight on (camera on the ground).', '2010-06-02 23:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6038446, 886783, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great colors in this photo. One thing that instantly popped in my head when I saw this was "something''s not quite right," and then I noticed the very titled horizon. I think if that was straightened, this would have been a more powerful image.</td>', 'Great colors in this photo. One thing that instantly popped in my head when I saw this was "something''s not quite right," and then I noticed the very titled horizon. I think if that was straightened, this would have been a more powerful image.', '2010-06-02 23:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6038450, 887038, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice find for this challenge. Really good clarity and colors.</td>', 'Nice find for this challenge. Really good clarity and colors.', '2010-06-02 23:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6038453, 887559, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good take on the challenge. Gives a real feeling of how vulnerable the little one it..</td>', 'Good take on the challenge. Gives a real feeling of how vulnerable the little one it..', '2010-06-02 23:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6038458, 887688, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice street capture. Good coloring and sharpness.</td>', 'Nice street capture. Good coloring and sharpness.', '2010-06-02 23:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6038461, 887703, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice idea for a portrait. I like the B&amp;W for this photo, and the feeling of contemplation. I do feel that the crop is a bit too tight on this one.</td>', 'Nice idea for a portrait. I like the B&W for this photo, and the feeling of contemplation. I do feel that the crop is a bit too tight on this one.', '2010-06-02 23:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6038463, 887228, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great idea for what looks like a fun family portrait. Nice job with exposure, especially in that mid-day sun.</td>', 'Great idea for what looks like a fun family portrait. Nice job with exposure, especially in that mid-day sun.', '2010-06-02 23:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6038465, 887426, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cute photo! Love the bamboo stick fishing pole. I don''t really care for the selective desaturation here. Feels like it would have been better with full B&amp;W or full color.</td>', 'Cute photo! Love the bamboo stick fishing pole. I don''t really care for the selective desaturation here. Feels like it would have been better with full B&W or full color.', '2010-06-02 23:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6038470, 887686, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great job capturing the fun. To me, the waves feel really bright, and the sky seems to have a lot of noise, which are both taking away from the image in my mind.</td>', 'Great job capturing the fun. To me, the waves feel really bright, and the sky seems to have a lot of noise, which are both taking away from the image in my mind.', '2010-06-02 23:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6038474, 887237, 114225, '<td valign="top">Took me a little bit to get the family reference, until I noticed the plates. The bunny is really pulling for my attention.</td>', 'Took me a little bit to get the family reference, until I noticed the plates. The bunny is really pulling for my attention.', '2010-06-02 23:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6038476, 887620, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great family portrait. The sand seems a bit over-sharpened, but only when looking close, so I don''t think it takes away from the image here.</td>', 'Great family portrait. The sand seems a bit over-sharpened, but only when looking close, so I don''t think it takes away from the image here.', '2010-06-02 23:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6038478, 887532, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge, but this type of shot really calls for the butterflies to be in sharp focus.</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge, but this type of shot really calls for the butterflies to be in sharp focus.', '2010-06-02 23:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6038482, 887528, 114225, '<td valign="top">I do see what you were going for here, and it''s a nice capture of the action, but I don''t feel it really fits family. Maybe if the focus was on a particular family in the stands, it could have fit better.</td>', 'I do see what you were going for here, and it''s a nice capture of the action, but I don''t feel it really fits family. Maybe if the focus was on a particular family in the stands, it could have fit better.', '2010-06-02 23:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6038486, 887711, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good idea for the challenge, and nice use of perspective and DOF. The bright side light isn''t working for me, feels like there should be at least some reflected light coming in from the left.</td>', 'Good idea for the challenge, and nice use of perspective and DOF. The bright side light isn''t working for me, feels like there should be at least some reflected light coming in from the left.', '2010-06-02 23:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6038487, 887137, 114225, '<td valign="top">I see what you were going for here. I don''t know how much it fits family, as I had sinks like that when living alone. Overall, a nice still life capture.</td>', 'I see what you were going for here. I don''t know how much it fits family, as I had sinks like that when living alone. Overall, a nice still life capture.', '2010-06-02 23:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6038488, 887393, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. I like the use of B7W in this one, and the quirky setup.</td>', 'Nice photo. I like the use of B7W in this one, and the quirky setup.', '2010-06-02 23:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
