(6041484, 887683, 103032, '<td valign="top">Wow, different take on this challenge; very outside the box.  Very provocative composition with the daughter''s ponytail as the instrument of the tug of war, and leaving the parents out of the picture except for their arms.  It certainly makes one think of how divorce affects the child(ren).  Very provocative with the sadness portrayed in the girl''s eye''s.  Technically well done, presented very well as the "antithesis" of family.  I think this deserves a 10 as a thought provoking image.</td>', 'Wow, different take on this challenge; very outside the box.  Very provocative composition with the daughter''s ponytail as the instrument of the tug of war, and leaving the parents out of the picture except for their arms.  It certainly makes one think of how divorce affects the child(ren).  Very provocative with the sadness portrayed in the girl''s eye''s.  Technically well done, presented very well as the "antithesis" of family.  I think this deserves a 10 as a thought provoking image.', '2010-06-05 00:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
